# survey26: reader survey 2026

Does a small blog need a custom-built survey?
No.
Did I build one anyway?
Yes.
Will anyone fill it out?
You tell me.

I've been writing here for almost a decade, and I still have no idea who reads this.
Time to find out.
Be honest, I can take it.
Probably.
Every question is optional, and the answers are capped at 1,000 characters, which is already beyond my attention span.

